{"content":[{"c":["BARZILLAI"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. One of three men who offered hospitality to David and his supporters at Mahanaim during the dangerous time of Absalom’s rebellion (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.17.27","r":"2Sam.17.27","rawR":"2Sam.17.27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.17.27","value":"2Sam.17.27"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 17:27"},"). After Absalom was defeated, Barzillai, a Gileadite, came to the Jordan River as David prepared to cross it in a triumphant return to Jerusalem. The 80-year-old Barzillai declined King David’s invitation to be his permanent guest in Jerusalem but sent his son Chimham in his place (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.19.31-40","r":"2Sam.19.31-40","rawR":"2Sam.19.31-40","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.19.31-40","value":"2Sam.19.31-40"}],"t":"ref","v":"19:31-40"},"; cf. ",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.2.7","r":"1Kgs.2.7","rawR":"1Kgs.2.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.2.7","value":"1Kgs.2.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 2:7"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Adriel’s father. Adriel married Saul’s daughter Merab (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.21.8","r":"2Sam.21.8","rawR":"2Sam.21.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.21.8","value":"2Sam.21.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 21:8"},"; cf. ",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.18.19","r":"1Sam.18.19","rawR":"1Sam.18.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.18.19","value":"1Sam.18.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Sm 18:19"},"). Barzillai was thus the paternal grandfather of five of the seven men hanged in Gibeon in recompense for Saul’s guilt in trying to wipe out all Gibeonites (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.21.1-9","r":"2Sam.21.1-9","rawR":"2Sam.21.1-9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.21.1-9","value":"2Sam.21.1-9"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 21:1-9"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Priest who married the daughter (or descendant) of #1 above and adopted the family name. His descendants returned to Jerusalem in 538 ",{"c":["BC"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"}," with Zerubbabel after the exile. They were refused priestly status because they had lost the genealogies establishing their heritage and priestly descent (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.2.61","r":"Ezra.2.61","rawR":"Ezra.2.61","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.2.61","value":"Ezra.2.61"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 2:61"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.7.63","r":"Neh.7.63","rawR":"Neh.7.63","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.7.63","value":"Neh.7.63"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 7:63"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Barzillai","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Sm 17:27","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.17.27","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.17.27","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.17.27"},{"anchorText":"19:31-40","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.19.31-40","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.19.31-40","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.19.31-40"},{"anchorText":"1 Kgs 2:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Kgs.2.7","rawQueryValue":"1Kgs.2.7","sourceRefExact":"1Kgs.2.7"},{"anchorText":"2 Sm 21:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.21.8","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.21.8","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.21.8"},{"anchorText":"1 Sm 18:19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Sam.18.19","rawQueryValue":"1Sam.18.19","sourceRefExact":"1Sam.18.19"},{"anchorText":"2 Sm 21:1-9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.21.1-9","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.21.1-9","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.21.1-9"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 2:61","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.2.61","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.2.61","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.2.61"},{"anchorText":"Neh 7:63","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.7.63","rawQueryValue":"Neh.7.63","sourceRefExact":"Neh.7.63"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"39b404f66d4025adb141706ab8afdb935ca51285bbd7386fb24dfac1123e12e0","sourceItemName":"Barzillai","sourceItemOrder":95,"sourceMember":"Articles/B.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Barzillai","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Barzillai","title":"Barzillai","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}